OL,1,Vk4                               G5/9
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGFOUR KILLED IN SARAJEVO
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGMORTAR ATTACK
OL,4,D
OL,5, Four people were killed and 10 injured
OL,6, in a mortar attack near a market in the
OL,7, besieged Bosnian city of Sarajevo this
OL,8, afternoon.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FThe mortar shell landed outside an
OL,11,Fapartment block in a residential part
OL,12,Fof the city opposite the TV station.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FTen days ago the same market was
OL,15,Fshelled and 15 people were killed and
OL,16,Fmore than 100 injured.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FMeanwhile, a prisoner exchange that was
OL,19,Fscheduled to take place outside the
OL,20,FBosnian capital this afternoon was
OL,21,Fpostponed.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG08-09-92F  teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
